                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Continuous items for most waves watching tv / reading papers / taking part in discussions on political issues / political knowledge / political participation / party preference / questions concerning importance of different political issues / left and right in politics. Wave 2: Rank ordering of values / geographic mobility tendency / attitude to war and peace and use of arms and nuclear weapons / foreign policy / consumer attitude related to income / attitude to working wife. Background variables: basic characteristics/ residence/ household characteristics/ occupation/employment/ income/capital assets/ politics/ religion/ organizational membership</p>"
